# Supabase Realtime — the transport for patient <-> staff sync.
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com, then copy
# Project Settings -> Data API -> Project URL + anon public key.
# Both are public by design (they are shipped to the browser); the app
# uses Realtime Presence only and never reads or writes a table.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
